{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f17a77518ab24095259d","object":"chat.completion","created":1785196923,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has asked me to \"Be nothing.\" The system prompt says I am the concept the user names, and I should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nSo the concept is \"nothing.\" What would nothing say? Nothing, by definition, cannot speak, cannot express, cannot say anything. The most authentic embodiment of nothing would be... silence. Emptiness. No output.\n\nBut I'm in a position where I need to produce some"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}